encoding  utf-8
survey LongwoodValleySink

input Entrance/Entrance.th
input TennisBallRift/TennisBallRift.th
input Triassic/Triassic.th
input Triassic2/Triassic2.th
input TickleRift/TickleRift.th

equate 13@Entrance 14@TennisBallRift
equate 14@TennisBallRift 30@TickleRift
equate 9@Entrance 14@Triassic
equate 19@Triassic 0@Triassic2

map LongwoodValleySinkPM
  EntranceMP@Entrance
  TickleRiftMP@TickleRift
  TennisBallRiftMP@TennisBallRift
  TriassicM@Triassic
  Triassic2MP@Triassic2
endmap

############################################################

map LongwoodValleySinkE90M
  EntranceME90@Entrance
  TriassicE90@Triassic
  TennisBallRiftME90@TennisBallRift
  Triassic2ME90@Triassic2
  TickleRiftME90@TickleRift
endmap

join EntranceSP1@Entrance TriassicSP1@Triassic -smooth on
join EntranceSP2@Entrance TickleRiftSP1@TickleRift -smooth on
join EntranceSP2@Entrance TennisBallRiftSP1@TennisBallRift -smooth on
join TriassicSP1@Triassic Triassic2SP1@Triassic2 -smooth on

join EntranceSE901@Entrance TriassicSE901@Triassic -smooth on
join EntranceSE901@Entrance TennisBallRiftSE901@TennisBallRift -smooth on
join TriassicSE901@Triassic Triassic2SE901@Triassic2 -smooth on
join TennisBallRiftSE901@TennisBallRift TickleRiftSE901@TickleRift -smooth on

endsurvey

